    {
      "context": "widget_eyeblink",
      "source": "Eye exercises (20 minutes recommended by eye doctors) are important to prevent tired eyes, we need to change our focus distance for a while. If include no mouse or keyboard activity as a break is enabled, these detected breaks are counted also as an eye exercise. For example, eye lids squeezing helps to fight Meibomian gland dysfunction. You can drag and drop the reminder to find a suitable location for it.",
      "comment": "",
      "translation": "眼部练习（眼科医生建议每 20 分钟一次）对预防眼疲劳很重要，我们需要暂时改变注视距离。如果启用了将无鼠标或键盘操作的时间计为休息，检测到的这些休息也会计为眼部练习。例如，用力闭合眼睑有助于应对睑板腺功能障碍。您可以拖动提醒，将其放在合适的位置。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "context": "widget_eyeblink",
      "source": "Eye exercises each 20 minutes",
      "comment": "",
      "translation": "每 20 分钟进行眼部练习",
      "status": "draft"
