    {
      "context": "widget_eyeblink",
      "source": "Eyeblink is now completely free. The income from premium licenses was not sufficient to cover the costs. If you consider eyeblink useful please make a donation and support the development of the new version (It will be big! Look forward 2022)",
      "comment": "",
      "translation": "Eyeblink 现已完全免费。高级版许可证的收入不足以支付成本。如果您觉得 eyeblink 有用，请捐赠并支持新版本的开发（将有重大变化！敬请期待 2022 年）。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "context": "widget_eyeblink",
      "source": "Eyeblink takes about 10 to 20% of CPU when processing images from \ncamera. Setting the frequency below 10 seconds increases the average \ncpu load. In such case, set the timer to turn off the screen, when PC inactive, \n(PC Settings -> System -> Power and Sleep ) as low as possible. \nIn such a case, eyeblink will automatically pause its features to save energy.",
      "comment": "",
      "translation": "Eyeblink 在处理摄像头图像时，大约占用 10 到 20% 的 CPU。\n将间隔设为少于 10 秒，会增加平均 CPU 负载。\n在这种情况下，请将电脑空闲时关闭屏幕的等待时间\n（电脑设置 -> 系统 -> 电源和睡眠）设得尽可能短。\n这样，eyeblink 会自动暂停其功能以节省电量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "context": "widget_eyeblink",
      "source": "Eyeblink will additionally measure your blink rate every half an hour. The measurement lasts about 3 minutes and the average blink rate will be displayed on the graph below. This measurement doesn't interfere with the Blink training.",
      "comment": "",
      "translation": "Eyeblink 还会每半小时测量一次您的眨眼频率。每次测量持续约 3 分钟，平均眨眼频率将显示在下方图表中。此测量不会干扰眨眼训练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
