      "source": "Software (-8 to 0) and hardware (0 to 10) screen brightness adjustment. \nSome monitors and graphics cards do not provide support for HW brightness\nadjustments, in such a case only a SW brightness adjustment is available.",
      "comment": "",
      "translation": "软件（-8 到 0）和硬件（0 到 10）屏幕亮度调节。\n部分显示器和显卡不支持硬件亮度调节，\n这种情况下仅可使用软件亮度调节。",
